stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: pengajuan dibuat

    Pending --> Approved: approver tahap 1 menyetujui<br/>(1-5 hari kerja)
    Pending --> PendingAdminApproval: approver tahap 1 menyetujui<br/>(6-10 hari kerja)
    Pending --> Rejected: approver tahap 1 menolak<br/>(alasan wajib)
    Pending --> Approved: Administrator override menyetujui<br/>(alasan wajib)
    Pending --> Rejected: Administrator override menolak<br/>(alasan wajib)
    Pending --> Cancelled: pemohon membatalkan<br/>(sebelum tanggal mulai)

    PendingAdminApproval --> Approved: Administrator menyetujui
    PendingAdminApproval --> Rejected: Administrator menolak<br/>(alasan wajib)
    PendingAdminApproval --> Cancelled: pemohon membatalkan<br/>(sebelum tanggal mulai)

    Approved --> Cancelled: pemohon membatalkan<br/>(sebelum tanggal mulai)
    Approved --> [*]: tanggal mulai tercapai

    Rejected --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]

    note right of Pending
        Saldo ditahan (Reserved)
    end note

    note right of PendingAdminApproval
        Saldo tetap ditahan (Reserved)
    end note

    note right of Approved
        Saldo ditahan dilepas
        Saldo terpakai bertambah
    end note

    note left of Rejected
        Status final
        Saldo ditahan dilepas
    end note

    note left of Cancelled
        Status final
        Saldo ditahan dilepas atau
        saldo terpakai dikurangi
    end note
